00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:21.930
The people who
contribute to Knative,

00:05:21.930 --> 00:05:25.770
who write code and improve
the Knative stack itself

00:05:25.770 --> 00:05:27.570
are the contributors here.

00:05:27.570 --> 00:05:30.070
They help the project
and improve it.

00:05:30.070 --> 00:05:33.300
Then people who take that
code and instantiate it,

00:05:33.300 --> 00:05:35.640
create an instance of
that and run it there,

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:37.230
we call them operators.

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:41.070
They can do that on any
certified Kubernetes instance

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:43.066
that are offered as a service.

