00:39:45.860 --> 00:39:47.300
I'm afraid.

00:39:47.300 --> 00:39:50.210
And then let's switch over here.

00:39:50.210 --> 00:39:53.270
And what we will see, that
using that configuration,

00:39:53.270 --> 00:39:54.350
we were able to--

00:39:54.350 --> 00:39:55.220
let's do this.

00:39:55.220 --> 00:39:59.450
Let's take that IoT and
