00:39:59.450 --> 00:40:02.330
here a little.

00:40:02.330 --> 00:40:07.001
A pod-- container user--

00:40:07.001 --> 00:40:10.270
container-- no.

00:40:10.270 --> 00:40:12.926
Well, it's helpful when
you spell it correctly.

00:40:12.926 --> 00:40:18.910
Container-- what we see
is the output of those.

00:40:18.910 --> 00:40:20.580
I haven't written
any specific code

00:40:20.580 --> 00:40:23.820
other than a function
that handles events.

00:40:23.820 --> 00:40:27.420
All the plumbing of that into
that code, into the route,

00:40:27.420 --> 00:40:29.220
was handle for me.

00:40:29.220 --> 00:40:32.640
You're still benefiting from all
